			 (Case When AccBS.NetF=1 then (1-@Discount/100) When AccBS.NetGroupF=1 then (1-@GDiscount/100) else 1 end)  
			*  
			 (1-(Case When AccBS.GrossUpF=0 and AccBS.NetUpF=0 Then (@GrossUpComm)/100 else 0 end))    
