When V.Payment_CC<V.AmountDue_1+V.AmountDue_2+V.AmountDue_3+V.AmountDue_4+V.AmountDue_5+V.AmountDue_6+V.AmountDue_7+V.AmountDue_8+V.AmountDue_9+V.AmountDue_10 then V.DueDate_10   
