and RArrDet.FullCoverF=0 and RArrDet.ANO=D.ANO 
and RArrDet.FID=@P_FID and FPart.ANO=RArrDet.ANO and FPart.FID=RArrdet.FID and RateCov.Code=FPart.Code and RateCov.TOR=ICalc.TOR
